#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:1
msgid "Krita's Freehand Selection tool reference."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:14
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Hulpmiddelen"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:14
msgid "Selection"
msgstr "Selectie"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:14
msgid "Freehand"
msgstr "Vrije hand"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:14
msgid "Outline Select"
msgstr "Selectie van omtrek"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:19
msgid "Freehand Selection Tool"
msgstr "Hulpmiddel voor selectie uit de vrije hand"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:21
msgid "|toolselectfreehand|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:23
msgid ""
"Make :ref:`selections_basics` by freely drawing the selection outline"
" around the canvas. Click and drag to draw a border around the section"
" you wish to select."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:27
msgid ""
"This tool was previously called as the Outline Selection tool. Starting"
" from Krita 4.4.2 release it has been renamed to Freehand Selection Tool."
" Most of the behavior of the Freehand Selection Tool is common to all"
" other selection tools, please make sure to read :ref:`selections_basics`"
" to learn more about this tool."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:32
msgid "Hotkeys and Sticky keys"
msgstr "Sneltoetsen en plakkende toetsen"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:34
msgid ""
":kbd:`R` sets the selection to 'replace' in the tool options, this is the"
" default mode."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`R` stelt de selectie in op 'vervangen' in de hulpmiddelopties, dit"
" is "
"de standaard modus."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:35
msgid ":kbd:`A` sets the selection to 'add' in the tool options."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`A` stelt de selectie in op 'toevoegen' in de hulpmiddelopties."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:36
msgid ":kbd:`S` sets the selection to 'subtract' in the tool options."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`S` stelt de selectie in op 'verminderen' in de hulpmiddelopties."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:37
msgid ""
":kbd:`Shift +` |mouseleft| sets the subsequent selection to 'add'. You"
" can release the :kbd:`Shift` key while dragging, but it will still be"
" set to 'add'. Same for the others."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`Shift +` |mouseleft| stelt de volgende selectie in op 'toevoegen'."
" U "
"kunt de :kbd:`Shift` toets loslaten tijdens het verslepen, maar het"
" blijft "
"ingesteld op 'toevoegen'. Hetzelfde voor de anderen."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:38
msgid ""
":kbd:`Alt +` |mouseleft| sets the subsequent selection to 'subtract'."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`Alt +` |mouseleft| stelt de volgende selectie in op 'verminderen'."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:39
msgid ""
":kbd:`Ctrl +` |mouseleft| sets the subsequent selection to 'replace'."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`Ctrl +` |mouseleft| stelt de vervolgende selectie in op 'vervangen'."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:40
msgid ""
":kbd:`Shift + Alt +` |mouseleft| sets the subsequent selection to"
" 'intersect'."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`Shift + Alt +` |mouseleft| stelt de volgende selectie in op "
"'doorsnede'."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:41
msgid ""
"Holding the :kbd:`Ctrl` key while drawing the selection temporarily makes"
" this tool behave like the Polygon Selection tool and you can then draw"
" straight line selections by just clicking on the canvas."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:45
msgid ""
"Hovering your cursor over the dashed line of the selection, or marching"
" ants as it is commonly called turns the cursor into the move tool icon,"
" which you |mouseleft| and drag to move the selection."
msgstr ""
"Als u met uw muis boven de stippellijn van de selectie zweeft, of lopende "
"mieren zoals ze vaak worden genoemd, dan verandert de cursor in het "
"pictogram voor verplaatsen, waarbij u dan met de|mouseleft| kan klikken"
" om "
"dan de selectie te verslepen."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:46
msgid ""
"|mouseright| will open up a selection quick menu with amongst others the"
" ability to edit the selection."
msgstr ""
"|mouseright| opent een selectie-contextmenu met onder anderen de "
"mogelijkheid om de selectie te bewerken."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:54
msgid ""
"You can switch the behavior of the :kbd:`Alt` key to use :kbd:`Ctrl`"
" instead by toggling the switch in Tool Settings in the"
" :ref:`general_settings`"
msgstr ""
"U kunt het gedrag van de :kbd:`Alt`-toets zo instellen dat het de :kbd:"
"`Ctrl`-toets gebruikt zonder dat u het in de :ref:`algemene instellingen` "
"hoeft in te stellen."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:58
msgid ""
"This tool is not bound to any Hotkey, if you want to define one, go to"
" :menuselection:`Settings --> Configure Krita --> Keyboard Shortcuts` and"
" search for 'Freehand Selection Tool', there you can select the shortcut"
" you want. Check :ref:`shortcut_settings` for more info."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:62
msgid "Tool Options"
msgstr "Hulpmiddelopties"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:67
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Modus"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:68
#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:70
msgid ""
"This option is explained in the :ref:`pixel_vector_selection` section."
msgstr ""
"Deze optie wordt uitgelegd in de sectie :ref:`pixel_vector_selection`."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:69
msgid "Action"
msgstr "Actie"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:72
msgid "Anti-aliasing"
msgstr "Anti-aliasing"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:72
msgid ""
"This toggles whether or not to give selections feathered edges. Some"
" people prefer hard-jagged edges for their selections."
msgstr ""
"Hiermee stelt u in of de selecties verdoezelde randen krijgt. sommige"
" mensen "
"geven de voorkeur aan zaagtandranden voor hun selecties."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:76
msgid "Anti-aliasing is only available on Pixel Selection Mode."
msgstr "Anti-aliasing is alleen beschikbaar bij de Pixel Selectie methode."
